<h1>About {{ site.site_name }}</h1>

<p>{{ site.site_name }} is a resource for craft enthusiasts looking for practical ideas, font recommendations, and project inspiration. We publish regularly updated guides covering tools, techniques, and product comparisons to help you plan your next project with confidence.</p>

<h2>What We Cover</h2>
<p>Our articles focus on practical, how-to content: choosing the right fonts and materials, comparing tools, avoiding common mistakes, and finding inspiration for craft projects.</p>

<h2>How We Choose What to Recommend</h2>
<p>We aim to recommend tools and resources based on what is genuinely useful for the type of projects discussed in each article. Some links on this site are affiliate links — see our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details.</p>

